###

### Получить корзину
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Добавить товар в корзину (productId = 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### Обновить количество (cartItemId = 1)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/cart/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "quantity": 5
}

###

### Удалить товар (cartItemId = 1)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cart/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Очистить корзину
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}